  team and the director (bilingual EN / 中文). ✅ = to-do\, 💻 = onlin
 e meeting\, ✈️ = travel\, 🎬 = director's schedule. All times Asia/S
 hanghai (UTC+8). 'TBC' items are shown as all-day events.\n“当河流轻
 声撕裂”筹备期 AD组与导演日程（中英对照）。✅ = 待
 办，💻 = 线上会议，✈️ = 出行，🎬 = 导演日程。所有
 时间均为北京时间（UTC+8）。“TBC”事项以全天事件显示
 。\nContact 联系: contact@hainazhou.com
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT1H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT1H
